                    "text": "(test)工人们的互助委托板$UNRELEASED"
                },
                {
                    "id": "771480402",
                    "speaker": "（test）伐木场公告板$UNRELEASED",
                    "text": "(test)想看哪条委托信息？$UNRELEASED",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "771480403",
